" Tridactyl config. Tracked in the dotfiles, shared by every machine.
" Read by the native messenger (AUR firefox-tridactyl-native[-bin]) from
" $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/tridactyl/tridactylrc -- ~/.configure here. Without the native
" messenger Tridactyl never reads this file. Reload by hand with :source.
"
" Ported 2026-10-03 from the Vimium settings in ~/.configure/vimium-backup/
" vimium-options.json, so the two browsers behave alike. Change one, change both.

" This file is the whole truth: forget anything set by hand with :set or :bind.
sanitise tridactyllocal tridactylsync

colours dark

" Search: DuckDuckGo by default (beast-arch task 73), `w <term>` for Wikipedia.
set searchengine duckduckgo
set searchurls.w https://www.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Special:Search&search=%s

" Hint characters, same as Vimium's linkHintCharacters.
set hintchars sadfjklewcmpgh

" Vimium keyMappings: Alt+j/k previous/next tab, Alt+h/l first/last tab,
" Alt+o/i back/forward.
bind <A-j> tabprev
bind <A-k> tabnext
bind <A-h> tabfirst
bind <A-l> tablast
bind <A-o> back
bind <A-i> forward

" Vimium exclusionRules: let Reddit's own keyboard shortcuts through.
unbindurl reddit\.com j
unbindurl reddit\.com k
unbindurl reddit\.com h
unbindurl reddit\.com l
unbindurl reddit\.com a
unbindurl reddit\.com z
unbindurl reddit\.com x
" Slack's Ctrl+Enter / Ctrl+U are typed into the message box, which is Tridactyl's
" insert mode, where it already passes keys through. No rule needed.
